      </div>
      <div class="feature-box">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4S14.21 4 12 4 8 5.79 8 8s1.79 4 4 4zM12 14c-4 0-7 2-7 4v2h14v-2c0-2-3-4-7-4z"/></svg>
        <h3>
